  "principal_findings": [
    "The discovery chain is publicly traceable from the C0 universe through separate META, STAT, and GDN results into the unscored candidate cohort, then through D1 fit and one-way train3 confirmation into the frozen relation cohort.",
    "Construction-time evidence materialization and the later D1 utility numeric authority are different authority layers. Treating them as one linear NUMERIC_AUTHORITY artifact hides a real custody boundary.",
    "COMMON-42 is a public metadata authority over an executable portfolio whose numeric values remain private. T0, T1, and T1-B are recorded as executable-equivalent for the shared portfolio; T2 remains a 39/3 historical construction observation and is excluded from utility execution.",
    "D0 and D1 public predictions are label-blind frozen authorities. D2 V1 and V2 consume those frozen predictions rather than rerunning D0 or D1.",
    "D0, D1, D2 V1, and D2 V2 each have public prediction, metric, and result-integrity evidence chains, with private score/metric evidence represented only by hashes.",
    "OUTER has a public blocker/custody record only and no prediction, metric, or scientific result artifact."
  ],
